## 🔥 Key Projects

### 🏛️ NyayaSathi — AI Legal Document Assistant
> Helps ordinary people understand complex legal documents like notices and judgments.
- Built a RAG pipeline with LangChain + Pinecone
- Multi-language support with fully grounded responses
- Deployed and production-ready

### 🎯 AI Interview Preparation Platform
> Built for IIT Bombay EdTech Society
- AI-generated domain-specific interview questions
- Personalized performance report with strengths & weaknesses scoring

